-- 5 October 2026, by Claude (agent), for Legalese. Residential Tenancies Act 1987 (WA) 07-a0-00 and the
-- Residential Tenancies Regulations 1989 (WA) 05-ad0-00.
--
-- This file is not part of the encoding certified at 6H. It imports the certified modules unchanged and
-- asserts what they compute on facts chosen to show a candidate finding; each section names the candidate
-- (incidents.json). Where a section needs a reading that is not in the fork register, it says so and
-- defines it here, under a name beginning with the candidate's ID, so that it cannot be mistaken for a
-- rule of the encoding. Nothing here decides whether a candidate is a defect: that is for 9A.
--
-- Run from the subject folder: l4 run lqa-evidence.l4

