-- R5: periodic from 1 March 2025 at $500; the lessor is an agency in the Table to r 5B(3) (the Housing Authority).
`R5 status` MEANS `Status facts` WITH
    `the lessor is an employer in the Table to r 5B(2A) and a tenant is its employee`                       IS FALSE
