#ASSERT NOT (`s 30 -- the notice` (`a s 30 notice under` "R5" `given on day` (`day number` 2026 1 2) `for weekly rent` 550 `from day` (`day number` 2026 4 1)) `increases the rent under` `R5` `from the day it specifies, given` (`the evidence history of` (LIST `R5`) `with` EMPTY) `and the holidays` `no evidence holidays`)

§ `M-21 -- s 100(4) does not reach a notice under s 31A for a fixed term within s 99`

-- IF1: a two-year fixed term entered into on 1 January 2024, rent calculated by reference to the tenant's
-- income. IP1: the same, periodic. Each has a notice of a change of method given on 1 June 2024 (before the
-- commencement) for 1 September 2024, less than 12 months after its tenancy commenced.
GIVEN nme IS A STRING, kd IS A `Kind of tenancy`, ex IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `Residential tenancy agreement`
`an income-based evidence agreement` nme `,` kd `, expiry` ex MEANS
    `Residential tenancy agreement` WITH
        `name`                                           IS nme
        `lessor`                                         IS "L"
        `granted by`                                     IS "L"
        `tenants`                                        IS LIST "T1"
        `premises`                                       IS "9 Evidence St"
        `kind`                                           IS kd
        `rent basis`                                     IS `calculated by reference to the tenant's income`
        `entered into on`                                IS `day number` 2024 1 1
        `tenancy commenced on`                           IS `day number` 2024 1 1
        `expiry day`                                     IS ex
        `weekly rent`                                    IS 300
        `the amount or method of an increase is set out` IS FALSE
        `provides that the rent may increase`            IS FALSE
        `rent increases excluded by agreement`           IS FALSE
        `notices under s 70A`                            IS EMPTY
        `possession delivered up on`                     IS NOTHING
        `terminated on`                                  IS NOTHING
        `status`                                         IS `no special status`

GIVEN nme IS A STRING
GIVETH A `Notice of increase of rent`
`the June 2024 change of method under` nme MEANS
    `Notice of increase of rent` WITH
        `under`                                      IS `section 31A`
        `agreement`                                  IS nme
        `given by the lessor`                        IS TRUE
        `in writing`                                 IS TRUE
        `form`                                       IS `a form approved by the Minister`
        `specifies the increased rent or the change` IS TRUE
        `specifies the day`                          IS TRUE
        `given`                                      IS `handed over on day` (`day number` 2024 6 1)
        `takes effect on`                            IS `day number` 2024 9 1
        `weekly rent from then`                      IS 320
        `withdrawn`                                  IS FALSE
        `within any limit agreed under s 30(2)(b)`   IS TRUE
        `any departure from the required form is immaterial and not misleading` IS TRUE

`IF1` MEANS `an income-based evidence agreement` "IF1" `,` `a tenancy for a fixed term` `, expiry` (JUST (`day number` 2025 12 31))
`IP1` MEANS `an income-based evidence agreement` "IP1" `,` `a periodic tenancy` `, expiry` NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 99(2) -- the section applies to` `IF1` `, given` (`the facts for ss 99 and 100 of` `IF1`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 100(2) -- the section applies to` `IF1` `, given` (`the facts for ss 99 and 100 of` `IF1`))
-- s 99(3) continues only s 30, which does not apply to income-based rent.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 30(1) -- the subsection applies to` `IF1`)
-- So s 100(4) reaches the June 2024 change under the periodic agreement, and not under the fixed term.
#ASSERT `s 100(4) -- reaches the notice` (`the June 2024 change of method under` "IP1") `under` `IP1` `, given` (`the facts for ss 99 and 100 of` `IP1`)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 100(4) -- reaches the notice` (`the June 2024 change of method under` "IF1") `under` `IF1` `, given` (`the facts for ss 99 and 100 of` `IF1`))

§ `M-20 -- the former s 30 asks for the Minister's form; the published form is approved under s 88C`

-- FK-26 reading B for the former s 30 (s 99(3)), for evidence only: the encoding defines reading B for the
-- present s 30(1) (`FK-26 reading B -- s 30(1) -- the notice is in the approved form`), not for the former.
GIVEN n IS A `Notice of increase of rent`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `M-20 FK-26 reading B -- former s 30(1) -- the notice is in a form approved by the Minister` n IF
    n's `form` EQUALS `a form approved by the Minister`

-- A notice under a fixed term within s 99, given on 1 October 2024 on the form approved under s 88C.
`a 2024 notice on the s 88C form` MEANS `Notice of increase of rent` WITH
    `under`                                      IS `section 30`
    `agreement`                                  IS "FA9"
    `given by the lessor`                        IS TRUE
    `in writing`                                 IS TRUE
    `form`                                       IS `the approved form (s 88C)`
    `specifies the increased rent or the change` IS TRUE
    `specifies the day`                          IS TRUE
    `given`                                      IS `handed over on day` (`day number` 2024 10 1)
    `takes effect on`                            IS `day number` 2025 1 1
    `weekly rent from then`                      IS 540
    `withdrawn`                                  IS FALSE
    `within any limit agreed under s 30(2)(b)`   IS TRUE
    `any departure from the required form is immaterial and not misleading` IS TRUE

-- On reading A (taken) the s 88C form is saved by Interpretation Act s 74; on reading B it is not the form
-- the former s 30(1) requires.
#ASSERT `former s 30(1) -- the notice has the form the subsection required` `a 2024 notice on the s 88C form`
#ASSERT NOT (`M-20 FK-26 reading B -- former s 30(1) -- the notice is in a form approved by the Minister` `a 2024 notice on the s 88C form`)
